<body>
    <h1>Manage Employees</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"ManageEmployees-Overview">Overview</h1>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:571px;m=
ax-width: 100%;" src=3D"8f709bd3289180f886b1ba96bc8ee21e7e77ce0566970d49ed3=
f94b6e3afd53c" height=3D"443"></p>
<h1 id=3D"ManageEmployees-IdentityModel">Identity Model</h1>
<p><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-image" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:1702px;=
max-width: 100%;" src=3D"a5abf9ee5232a324d7ccbdd6887c8bd11f3d0f8e67e5e89e29=
73f13cee3b1548" height=3D"255"></p>
<h1 id=3D"ManageEmployees-DatabaseSpecifications">Database Specifications</=
h1>
<p><strong>N.B.</strong> <span style=3D"color:#c9372c;">As a result of the =
following specifications, FUM APIs (i.e. User Configuration, AuthR API, Fir=
m Configuration, ...) would need to be modified accordingly, as well as any=
 database artefact (e.g. tables, views, stored procedures, ...) referencing=
 the <em>User_Configuration</em> table.</span></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Req. No</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Name</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Description</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Comments</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.001</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">NEW</=
span> Table <em>Person</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Table maintaining a physical person information.</p>
     <p>e.g. Name, email, organization, language, ...</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>A National Bank employee would have the&nbsp;<em>organization</em>&=
nbsp;set to "NBC".</p>
     <p><strong>N.B.</strong> The <em>email</em> must be unique</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.002</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-success">NEW</=
span> Table <em>PersonUser</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Table mapping a physical person to virtual u=
ser(s)</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>A National Bank employee may have several user accounts:</p>
     <ul style=3D"list-style-type: square;">
      <li data-uuid=3D"935c1d4e-c569-49d0-a67e-07ed4ee67f0a">A <u><strong>s=
ingle</strong></u> internal user account (with a <em>shortId</em> as idp_su=
bject/username) for internal SSO access to Compass X;</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a93a93c5-b1e2-4688-91da-8ea41820bac0">(Optionally) E=
xternal user account(s) for external access to Compass X.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">FR.003</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"status-macro aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-moved">MODIFIE=
D</span> Table <em>User</em></p>
      <p>p.s. Formerly <em>User_Configuration</em></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Table maintaining a virtual user information.</p>
     <p>e.g. Username, IdP information, linked IDs, user preferences, ...</=
p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
